# Whoever holds the class object can store into a static field, so Link proves nothing of the field's variable: it counts as shared with code that nobody has read. What was seen to be stored is a number.
# The reading that says what is expected says so, and the walk asks it at the read: one test for a number, and the sum is a sum of numbers.
# RUN: link variables held mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES: entries-of-bun
# CHECK: variable g3 proven=i32
# The proving reading says what it said: nothing.
# RUN(PROVEN): link variables mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES(PROVEN): entries-of-bun
# PROVEN-NOT: variable g3 proven=
# RUN(WALK): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES(WALK): entries-of-bun
# WALK: GetStaticFieldOrAbsent {{*}} variable=g3
# WALK: TypeTest {{*}} testedType=i32
# WALK: Add {{*}} form=Numbers
